    Rendering.Enablement.md. Current diffuse behavior and fixed allowance are documented in PBR.Clouds.md.
  Private diffuse programs gather eight cube-corner directions through stored density/direct and the
    coherent old diffuse field. Actual half-voxel intervals, 400-metre closure, one environment boundary,
