    partial writes; untouched physical values survive rescaling. Empty/disabled batches skip copy/swap;
    source envelopes remain field-owned and compatible energy is retained. Failure cannot publish its
    destination, encoding, bounds or completed stamps. Copy bytes are charged separately from job count.
