  [ ] Extend affected existing demand/fairness/occupancy/publication checks only. Use subagents for
      focused incremental validation, reuse evidence and avoid full matrices/packaging. Compare useful
      jobs, backlog/age and total CPU/GPU cost; no approximation-quality or convergence thresholds.
  [ ] Completion: unnecessary maintenance is removed or explicitly justified, useful update throughput
